  "description": "ZIGYUN crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H88 Dy6 F18 N4 O40 S6,2(C2 H6 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.487-3.710 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.44-110.04°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C82H100Dy6F18N4O42S6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
